<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-126-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.483922" lon="-121.057308"><name>SC26-126-A</name><cmt>SC26-126</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 17.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 83/100; not catch probability. Center 132 ft; nearby 112–153 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-099</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.48712177703151" lon="-121.05728573651271"/><trkpt lat="35.48687626404825" lon="-121.05883477256113"/><trkpt lat="35.48599815182309" lon="-121.06028878299854"/><trkpt lat="35.48528608595782" lon="-121.06085700450504"/><trkpt lat="35.48393966772542" lon="-121.06122001542708"/><trkpt lat="35.483757666094874" lon="-121.06111416880525"/><trkpt lat="35.48365692390721" lon="-121.06045527585746"/><trkpt lat="35.48311268857392" lon="-121.06024791921479"/><trkpt lat="35.48319040028634" lon="-121.05947452379874"/><trkpt lat="35.48246947751293" lon="-121.05949185814067"/><trkpt lat="35.48227506562037" lon="-121.05861479694858"/><trkpt lat="35.48092333582743" lon="-121.05864731163135"/><trkpt lat="35.480804840331764" lon="-121.05688672312814"/><trkpt lat="35.480985070805026" lon="-121.05688238405115"/><trkpt lat="35.480